WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
http://doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.950
We hire servants in Sosnovy Bor

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:47.490
This is not a letter

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.750
What is this then?

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.830
If it conveys your feelings, it's a letter

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.050
I must have looked pathetic in my attempts.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.380
get here as a servant

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.350
You were an incredibly skilled teacher.

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.180
I feel sorry for you

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.600
Have you at least learned to be faithful?
yes fulfill duties

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.850
My teacher tried so hard for me

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:17.190
I thought I should give it my all

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:20.860
Did this stress you out?

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:23.650
Not really. But I doubted

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:29.290
Answer you as a student or as a master

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:32.540
Or answer in the style of what you read

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.330
And what did you read?

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:39.960
Then answer the same?

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.010
Also? What are you talking about?

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:45.260
It's written right there

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:47.760
"I'll go through anything just to see you"

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:51.640
“I can do anything, just to have the opportunity to see you”

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:53.810
And this is my answer

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:06.570
I missed you too

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:11.790
This is my answer

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.230
I'll pretend I didn't hear this

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.280
And forget about the letter

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.950
You can't get rid of something

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.500
if you've already shared it with someone

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.330
You can get rid of

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, Tommo, Zero Amamiya

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.630
You can burn it

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.670
as if it never happened

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.220
Do you think you will burn it - and the letter did not exist?

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.390
Only here, teacher,

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:13.470
your student

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.770
learned to see what cannot be seen

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:22.480
I read Words of the Heart. Do you want to check?

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.320
We need to concentrate

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.320
to read what you can't see

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:31.820
And then...

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.330
say the addressee's name

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.000
Moo Deok

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.670
A clear but dangerous signal

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:48.300
I'm in love with him

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:52.970
There you go. I read

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.850
Something is hard to read because it's hidden,

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.060
but it is there

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.190
You saw the mark in my eyes, you knew that I was a nomad,

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:09.360
that's how he caught me

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.160
Now I saw my other weakness

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:15.120
If this is your weakness,

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.330
then mine too

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.710
Your letter is my answer

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.460
So we have one weakness

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.260
I think I don't mind sharing my weakness with you

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.180
To be honest, I was worried

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.890
You finally got what you wanted

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:40.680
And I couldn't do anything even if you left me

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:44.940
I even thought about poisoning you

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.770
and find something to denigrate

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:49.320
Chan Wook,

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.280
Apparently you're already poisoned

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:55.990
Poisoned?

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.200
You will become weak and infirm

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:01.250
There is no escape from this poison

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:04.330
The antidote is the person who poisoned you

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:07.000
So that's why I missed you

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.550
what was poisoned?

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.550
Yes

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.640
You were mercilessly poisoned by a shadow warrior

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.600
Think like this

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.350
This is not far from the truth

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.060
So it's poison?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.440
Well, yes, it was strange that among everyone

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:28.860
I missed you

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.280
You were always threatening to kill me

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.150
She even threw a knife at me

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.620
Laughed at me, I almost lost my arm

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.410
And you have the nerve to lie

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.740
You were cruel to me

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.000
but I couldn't help but think about you

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.960
I open my eyes - I already miss you

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:48.540
I miss you all day, even when I go to bed

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.000
- Stop it
- Why?

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:52.460
I confessed my feelings, and you compared them to poison

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:55.430
So at least listen to what my symptoms are.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.010
You are my antidote

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.980
I just said that I missed you, you terrible shadow warrior

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.560
And you say I'm poisoned

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.190
Now bear with my complaints about symptoms

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:08.560
I was poisoned, after all

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.020
I have nothing to be ashamed of

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:13.900
Since you are an antidote, that means you are related to the poisoning

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:30.250
This is the nephew of the head of Sosnovy Bor

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.550
and our next chapter

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:41.720
I came to greet you on behalf of the head

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.600
Congratulations on joining Sosnovy Bor

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:46.690
Well done

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:52.360
You did a good job today

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.740
Today you will be offered booze and meat

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:58.860
You can have some fun

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.700
Go, eat, drink

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.540
Follow me

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.330
Mister,

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.340
do you know Moo Deok?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.250
She passed the exam today

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:18.260
The servant who came last

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:23.010
One hundred twenty five

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.780
Room 125, Moo Deok

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.530
Gone!

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:55.550
I know Moo Deok well

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:59.340
She lost consciousness and was taken to Saejukwon

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.890
I have to return her things

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:06.850
and give the amulet to enter

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:09.520
Is she still in Saejukwon?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.400
Give it to me. I'll pass it on

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.820
You did a good job today

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:22.200
Let's go

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.180
Moo Deok...

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:11.960
You're lost because it's in your head

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.460
too many thoughts

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.170
When this happens, think about one thing

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:23.680
Nak Soo, the only one you think about is Chan Wook

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:40.230
Listen, Yul

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.820
I accidentally looked into Moo Deok's bag

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:48.200
and found something strange

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.750
This is your whistle, right?

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.290
The one you lost in Danhyangok

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.380
Yes, my

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:01.550
Then why does Moo Deok have it?

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.060
Have you seen Mr. Dan Gu?

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:19.230
He has my things and an amulet for entry

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.320
He gave them to me

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:26.740
I see

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:28.700
I'll take

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.800
I lost it in Danhyangok. Did you find him there?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.050
Yes

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:49.470
I took it because...

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.470
In love with me

00:10:57.850 --> 00:10:59.770
You said so yourself

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.480
This explanation is enough

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.490
I'll pick up my things

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.540
and you take the whistle

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.210
I told Dan Gu that I gave it to you

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:23.960
I can't take it back

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:28.260
Why are you giving it to me?

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:30.930
You didn't believe it when I confessed my love

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.640
Then you had to make me believe

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:46.320
I was just making fun of them

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:49.610
And Moo Deok really loves Yulia

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.200
And considering Julia’s gift,

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.780
I think he has a soft spot for her too

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.830
She probably begged for that whistle

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.920
When she needs something

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.000
she lies and dodges easily

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.710
Yul even knew about her participation in the exam

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.300
He answered all the questions for her sake

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:12.430
She definitely asked him to help,

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:14.680
because I'm too stupid myself

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:17.430
She always gets what she wants

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.810
What's more important

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:24.360
I saw how cute they were walking together

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.150
What?

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:28.190
Cute?

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:38.040
Moo Deok and Yul met once

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:42.080
I think you didn't know because you were locked in the training room.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.580
That's right

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.010
Yes, I didn't know

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.740
What if this is true?

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.450
I missed you too

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.660
This is my answer

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.340
She refused because she doesn't like me

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.180
She didn't miss her like I did

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:40.060
I'm the only one who missed you

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.110
I...

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:50.360
I want to drink poison and die

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.700
What a shame

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:13.880
I like you

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:17.340
I've told you about this hundreds of times

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.350
I don't know much about love

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:30.020
but when you like someone you don't repeat it over and over again

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.110
Because it’s hard to admit even once

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.080
This whistle

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:46.040
belonged to a friend to whom I could never confess

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:56.050
I really like you

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:08.600
I really wanted to tell her about this

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:15.690
I want to try too

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:18.450
Can I?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:59.700
You have now entered Sosnovy Bor. We will see each other more often

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:04.660
You can come to me if you need anything

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.460
Thank you

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.160
Chan Wook read "Words of the Heart"

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.030
You helped him, right?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:49.370
I found out that he could, so I came to tell you

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:54.540
Tell Jin to deliver this book to Jinyeowon.

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.050
Bone

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:58.630
Why?

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.760
Chang Wook is angry that everyone is reading this “letter”

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:06.970
I think Master Seo Kyung would feel the same way

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:10.270
Apparently you really like Chan Wook

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.810
He's special, that's why I watch him

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.860
He's very smart

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:20.360
but Jin wants to lock him here

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.990
Are you sure

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.780
that the ice stone is not in Sosnovy Bor?

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.540
Why did you decide this?

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.660
20 years ago

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:36.040
Gwangju Chang Gang mastered the alchemy of souls

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.300
Because of this

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:42.010
a child was born who should not have

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:46.470
And that night the King's star shone in the sky

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:49.260
Is this Chan Wook?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.220
Yes

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:55.690
The magician unsealed the stone in Sosnovy Bor

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.610
and through the alchemy of souls the king's son was born

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:05.820
Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan knows this

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:11.160
If they already have the stone, what excuse can there be?

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:14.040
come up with Pine Forest,

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.830
to pick him up?

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:27.390
Jin has no other way to protect Pine Forest than to hide Uka

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:28.890
Why?

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:32.720
Is there something I don't know?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.230
Oh you little one...

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:47.450
How can anyone trust such a careless and imprudent youth with secrets?!

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.580
How could you...

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.620
I hope it washes off

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.420
He's so...

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.790
didn't get angry even when I said more

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:02.500
I won't drink chastity tea

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:08.930
Wait, the scarf was a gift from Kim's maid

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:32.200
Cleaning must be completed before

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.620
how the magicians will begin their classes. Faster

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:35.540
- Yes
- Yes

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.930
Where is the owner?

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.060
- He won't come?
- Well...

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.400
I went to wake him up

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.730
but he said that he didn’t sleep a wink last night

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.070
And he'll take a walk? On the first day?

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.150
See you, Moo Deok

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.010
Owner

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:29.550
We have to get up

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.430
Master!

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.520
Wake up

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.020
Otherwise I'll hit you

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:40.270
Get up!

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:51.820
Don't make any noise and go, I'll sleep

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.660
Are you crazy? Did you want death?

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.040
Yes, I'm crazy and I want to die

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:03.750
What's wrong with you?

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:06.380
These are the symptoms of my poisoning

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:10.670
Chan Wook, stop being stubborn and angry

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.720
I said I'm the antidote

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:17.050
Here

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.100
Here I am

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:32.820
I'm sorry

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.340
Hey Chan Wook

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:52.090
I heard you read Words of the Heart. I'm surprised

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:53.840
There is nothing to be surprised

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:56.260
I see you are reading about the Hyonggon technique

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.550
I mastered this sword style as a child.

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:02.020
If you teach me to read "Words of the Heart",

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:03.810
I will help you master Hyonggon

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:07.360
We need to think

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:12.070
Agree. Say you agree

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:16.160
Listen, I'm tired of something

00:22:17.450 --> 00:22:20.490
Ask Master Li for help

00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:30.380
Chan Wook

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:33.550
I mastered Ryusu in about the same time as you

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:37.050
Don't you want to fight me?

00:22:37.130 --> 00:22:39.430
Then I'll lend you a sapphire carpet

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:41.470
for training

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:45.230
With its help, energy can be doubled

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:48.600
Sapphire carpet? This is such a rarity

00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:51.900
Master, this is a good opportunity.

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:56.570
But such a carpet is cold, right?

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.280
I get sick quickly

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:02.410
That's why I don't need this

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:11.840
What are you doing?

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:16.840
I haven't slept well these days, I'm going to take a nap

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:21.720
Missed the chance to master Hyonggon

00:23:21.800 --> 00:23:22.810
Are you completely crazy?

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:25.640
And yesterday. The sapphire carpet is hard to come by,

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:27.140
and you said he was cold

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:29.770
I had to agree even if I could die on it

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:32.480
Incredible. "Crazy. Die"

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:34.400
That's all you tell me

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:37.700
Give it here

00:23:47.830 --> 00:23:48.750
What are you doing?

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:50.370
You can't lie here together

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:53.130
You will only go to bed if I get up

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:57.970
Get up

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:00.220
And you make

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:03.180
It won't be hard

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:19.070
I said I missed you

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:22.740
and you said I'm poisoned, so I need to sleep and come to my senses

00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:24.830
Stop messing with me, at least for a little while.

00:24:28.950 --> 00:24:31.620
You just want to upset me

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:35.090
I told you, if I die, you will die too

00:24:35.880 --> 00:24:38.630
I'm in agony, you should feel something too

00:24:38.710 --> 00:24:41.880
When I sleep I even have cramps

00:24:48.350 --> 00:24:49.810
And for how long?

00:24:51.020 --> 00:24:51.850
I don't know

00:24:52.480 --> 00:24:54.110
What? Upsetting?

00:24:54.730 --> 00:24:56.400
Then help me make myself more comfortable

00:25:05.620 --> 00:25:09.540
The owner sleeps all the time

00:25:09.620 --> 00:25:12.080
Tell him to train

00:25:12.160 --> 00:25:14.040
Jeongjingak's magicians train at will

00:25:14.130 --> 00:25:17.210
Each person harnesses their energy differently

00:25:17.290 --> 00:25:19.670
I won't interfere as long as he doesn't break the rules

00:25:21.090 --> 00:25:22.010
But...

00:25:22.090 --> 00:25:24.470
Don't worry. Here he is

00:25:30.470 --> 00:25:33.140
My head hurts

00:25:33.230 --> 00:25:34.520
I'll go home

00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:37.110
and I’ll come to my senses, soaking in the water

00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:41.650
Does your head hurt? You didn't do anything

00:25:42.240 --> 00:25:45.240
And you can't go home either. It's not according to the rules

00:25:45.320 --> 00:25:46.410
Yes?

00:25:46.490 --> 00:25:49.160
Chan Wook is an exception. He has the head's permission

00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:50.700
Why him?

00:25:50.790 --> 00:25:53.790
Busy with all sorts of entertainment, you had no time

00:25:53.870 --> 00:25:56.790
but I made a deal with the head while I was locked here

00:25:59.590 --> 00:26:00.590
I'll be back soon

00:26:05.050 --> 00:26:06.590
I'll go with him

00:26:08.050 --> 00:26:09.970
If you go, you will be kicked out of here

00:26:10.060 --> 00:26:13.350
You tried so hard to get here. Are you ready to just leave?

00:26:23.990 --> 00:26:26.070
Chan Wook went home

00:26:26.160 --> 00:26:27.660
Are you sure this is correct?

00:26:27.740 --> 00:26:31.080
Let him go wherever he wants

00:26:32.790 --> 00:26:34.500
Then he will become lazy

00:26:35.120 --> 00:26:36.000
Chapter

00:26:39.960 --> 00:26:42.460
The lady asks you to wait a little

00:26:43.300 --> 00:26:46.220
Is she hosting someone?

00:26:52.390 --> 00:26:55.140
I saw Jeonbugwan's servant on the way here

00:26:55.230 --> 00:26:58.310
Maybe Deputy Jin Mu is here?

00:26:58.400 --> 00:27:02.980
They're not close enough to see each other like that

00:27:04.150 --> 00:27:07.660
Just in case, go and check who's leaving

00:27:18.830 --> 00:27:20.460
If Master Li wants it that way,

00:27:20.540 --> 00:27:23.590
we will hide "Words of the Heart" in Jinyeowon

00:27:25.340 --> 00:27:28.300
Did you see anyone else today?

00:27:29.180 --> 00:27:30.640
Distant relative

00:27:32.810 --> 00:27:37.060
Will Jin Jo Young inherit Jinyoung?

00:27:39.060 --> 00:27:40.520
It's not decided yet

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:43.820
My eldest daughter may still be alive

00:27:46.030 --> 00:27:48.240
It's been ten years since then

00:27:49.450 --> 00:27:51.370
And even though she is blind,

00:27:51.450 --> 00:27:55.410
she could sense energy and control relics like no one else

00:27:55.490 --> 00:27:57.200
He was a very smart child

00:27:57.290 --> 00:27:58.710
Unlike other children,

00:27:59.620 --> 00:28:02.920
she was born at 13 months

00:28:04.460 --> 00:28:07.920
She was born on the day that Gwangju Chang Gang named

00:28:08.010 --> 00:28:09.470
blessed by heaven

00:28:11.720 --> 00:28:15.470
Was she born on the day Chang Gang chose for you?

00:28:16.930 --> 00:28:18.100
Is it possible

00:28:18.180 --> 00:28:22.230
choose the date and time of birth of the child?

00:28:23.360 --> 00:28:24.900
It was a coincidence

00:28:26.570 --> 00:28:29.900
I would like to invite Master Lee to Jinyeowon

00:28:30.490 --> 00:28:31.780
Give him this

00:28:33.030 --> 00:28:34.120
Okay

00:28:49.880 --> 00:28:51.930
I carried her for 13 months

00:28:52.010 --> 00:28:55.050
I can't let her go so easily

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:58.560
I heard the stone has power

00:28:58.640 --> 00:29:01.560
bring dead souls back to life

00:29:08.190 --> 00:29:09.320
Gwangju

00:29:11.360 --> 00:29:12.570
Help me

00:29:22.870 --> 00:29:27.500
I came this far to protect my child

00:29:38.850 --> 00:29:40.100
I will find you

00:29:42.520 --> 00:29:44.690
I'll do my best

00:29:46.520 --> 00:29:47.860
to find you

00:29:59.790 --> 00:30:02.830
- Did you check who this important guest was?
- Yes

00:30:04.370 --> 00:30:07.840
It was Deputy Jin Mu

00:30:10.170 --> 00:30:12.300
Since when is the head of Jinyeowon

00:30:12.380 --> 00:30:15.630
considers him a member of the family and accepts him?

00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:17.550
He quietly left through the back gate

00:30:18.300 --> 00:30:21.020
So the meeting was secret

00:30:22.180 --> 00:30:24.890
I wonder what tricks he used

00:30:24.980 --> 00:30:27.940
slippery Jin Mu to freely visit Jinyoewon?

00:30:45.290 --> 00:30:48.670
You're blind so you don't know where you are

00:30:49.790 --> 00:30:52.800
You will be silent and do what they ask,

00:30:53.380 --> 00:30:54.920
save your life

00:30:55.550 --> 00:30:57.380
So that not a sound

00:30:57.470 --> 00:30:58.550
Get up

00:32:18.880 --> 00:32:20.050
Sit down

00:32:28.310 --> 00:32:30.940
Leave her, the rest can go

00:32:34.480 --> 00:32:36.730
They are looking for the girl from the portrait

00:32:36.820 --> 00:32:38.320
Apparently she's blind

00:32:39.360 --> 00:32:42.320
He said the others could go, why no sounds?

00:33:11.890 --> 00:33:13.400
You can see

00:33:15.980 --> 00:33:18.900
It's a pity. I thought I found the right girl

00:33:19.440 --> 00:33:20.360
Kill her

00:33:24.240 --> 00:33:25.870
I can do it!

00:33:27.740 --> 00:33:31.330
I can be the girl from the portrait

00:33:37.290 --> 00:33:38.500
Spare me

00:33:39.210 --> 00:33:40.880
You said I'm coming

00:33:42.090 --> 00:33:43.970
If you have to be blind,

00:33:47.100 --> 00:33:49.180
then I will be like that

00:34:03.780 --> 00:34:06.990
Entertaining girl. Get up

00:34:12.910 --> 00:34:15.080
So can you pretend to be blind?

00:34:15.920 --> 00:34:17.580
I'm already blind

00:34:21.130 --> 00:34:23.590
Well, let's check it out

00:35:01.960 --> 00:35:04.800
I think I really found what I needed

00:35:24.400 --> 00:35:25.860
So be it

00:35:25.940 --> 00:35:29.950
From now on, you are Jin Bu Young, Jinyoung's lost daughter.

00:35:31.070 --> 00:35:32.120
Yes

00:35:33.290 --> 00:35:35.120
I'm Jin Bu Young

00:35:47.300 --> 00:35:49.300
Chan Wook stopped training again

00:35:53.760 --> 00:35:57.270
How should I punish him this time?

00:36:02.560 --> 00:36:04.730
Thanks to me you work hard

00:36:09.200 --> 00:36:10.110
Yes

00:36:10.700 --> 00:36:13.950
Thanks to you, I'll have to sweep the yard again.

00:36:21.380 --> 00:36:22.630
Are you arguing with me?

00:36:23.670 --> 00:36:24.840
Then I'll help you leave

00:36:24.920 --> 00:36:26.250
You cheated

00:36:26.800 --> 00:36:28.920
If I say anything about this, you'll be thrown out of here right away.

00:36:31.220 --> 00:36:32.800
Sorry, Your Highness

00:36:33.890 --> 00:36:36.970
I'm grateful for the leaves that fell with your help

00:36:37.060 --> 00:36:39.600
You can continue shaking the tree

00:36:41.400 --> 00:36:43.060
We need to thank

00:36:44.020 --> 00:36:46.480
for answers, not for leaves

00:36:48.530 --> 00:36:53.450
So you didn’t come to grumble, but for gratitude

00:36:53.530 --> 00:36:56.240
It takes me a long time to understand, Your Highness

00:36:56.330 --> 00:36:58.250
I am immensely grateful to you

00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:02.120
Of course you are grateful. I wrote down the answers myself

00:37:03.670 --> 00:37:06.090
Do you even know how to wash ink?

00:37:07.460 --> 00:37:10.590
Have you written an answer?

00:37:11.220 --> 00:37:14.010
Yes. I'm the Crown Prince

00:37:14.090 --> 00:37:16.600
I learned that rice paste removes ink

00:37:17.220 --> 00:37:20.310
I even tried it myself, it works

00:37:21.020 --> 00:37:22.390
There are simply no words

00:37:23.980 --> 00:37:26.110
I am forever in your debt

00:37:27.690 --> 00:37:28.820
So what?

00:37:29.740 --> 00:37:31.240
Happy to be with your owner?

00:37:32.650 --> 00:37:34.280
I heard he read "Words of the Heart"

00:37:34.360 --> 00:37:35.490
Yes

00:37:35.570 --> 00:37:38.950
Among the magicians of Jeongjingak, he did it the fastest

00:37:42.080 --> 00:37:44.000
It's unlikely to be a matter of talent and skills alone

00:37:44.580 --> 00:37:46.250
Surely you were lucky again

00:37:47.290 --> 00:37:50.090
But he defeated you in a duel

00:37:53.300 --> 00:37:56.930
I know what Chan Wook is capable of because I fought him.

00:37:58.310 --> 00:38:01.100
Poor sword skills, weak spells

00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:04.900
He was lucky to use Tansu. It's not about skills

00:38:06.190 --> 00:38:08.230
He's right about something

00:38:08.980 --> 00:38:12.610
That's why he came to Jeongjingak. Become a powerful magician

00:38:12.690 --> 00:38:15.820
In fact, he lacked the skills to even join Jeongjingak

00:38:16.490 --> 00:38:19.910
If he defeats anyone here,

00:38:20.660 --> 00:38:22.290
I recognize him

00:38:23.580 --> 00:38:26.630
It would be nice to use the Crown Prince

00:38:26.710 --> 00:38:27.790
Your Highness

00:38:28.340 --> 00:38:31.710
Or maybe we can argue?

00:38:32.550 --> 00:38:33.720
Shall we argue?

00:38:35.050 --> 00:38:37.180
What do I get from arguing with you?

00:38:38.390 --> 00:38:42.220
I'll give you the most precious thing I have

00:38:50.480 --> 00:38:51.860
I'll be the first to choose

00:38:51.940 --> 00:38:53.820
I'll take red, you take blue

00:38:59.030 --> 00:39:01.830
Wait. I'll come there

00:39:02.490 --> 00:39:03.870
I missed you too

00:39:05.330 --> 00:39:06.670
This is my answer

00:39:16.760 --> 00:39:18.390
- Mister
- Yes

00:39:19.010 --> 00:39:21.100
I bought your favorite cookies

00:39:21.930 --> 00:39:23.390
Are you staying for lunch?

00:39:23.470 --> 00:39:25.480
I returned home for a couple of days

00:39:26.430 --> 00:39:29.650
- Is this possible?
- The head gave permission

00:39:29.730 --> 00:39:31.980
Made me an exception in everything

00:39:32.070 --> 00:39:33.360
Of course

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:36.190
You read "Words of the Heart" in a couple of days

00:39:36.280 --> 00:39:39.450
It's stupid to force you to follow the same rules as ordinary magicians

00:39:40.490 --> 00:39:42.910
Are you happy about my success?

00:39:42.990 --> 00:39:44.830
I'm not just happy

00:39:44.910 --> 00:39:47.210
You have no idea how proud I am

00:39:49.040 --> 00:39:50.460
Maid Kim,

00:39:50.540 --> 00:39:54.170
I constantly disappointed you, and now you can be proud

00:39:54.250 --> 00:39:57.090
Should I buy you a beautiful dress?

00:39:57.170 --> 00:39:58.590
You look

00:39:58.680 --> 00:40:02.720
I don't need anything. I feel like I have everything

00:40:03.970 --> 00:40:05.430
People came

00:40:05.520 --> 00:40:08.940
and told me that you are your father's son

00:40:10.770 --> 00:40:11.770
Yes?

00:40:12.360 --> 00:40:14.650
Your father was called a genius

00:40:14.730 --> 00:40:18.240
And now they say that you are as talented as your father

00:40:20.240 --> 00:40:22.620
People said I don't look like him at all

00:40:25.990 --> 00:40:27.620
You will make progress

00:40:28.290 --> 00:40:31.960
and people won't say anything like that about you anymore

00:40:32.040 --> 00:40:35.210
What if there is no success? Will they start spreading rumors again?

00:40:37.090 --> 00:40:38.210
No, it's not like that...

00:40:39.550 --> 00:40:42.640
Tell them they are free to say whatever they want.

00:40:42.720 --> 00:40:44.010
It doesn't bother me anymore

00:40:45.060 --> 00:40:47.890
Yes. You can't worry about this anymore

00:40:49.940 --> 00:40:54.900
And besides, your successes are your merits

00:40:54.980 --> 00:40:56.360
Which side is the father here?

00:40:57.070 --> 00:40:59.440
He was never around

00:41:00.030 --> 00:41:03.700
And in general, it's all because I

00:41:03.780 --> 00:41:05.160
raised you well

00:41:11.960 --> 00:41:15.000
You will always be my dear sir,

00:41:15.920 --> 00:41:18.550
with or without success

00:41:20.010 --> 00:41:21.050
Really?

00:41:22.550 --> 00:41:26.050
Then you can go home and be lazy?

00:41:27.810 --> 00:41:29.770
Yes, if you want it

00:41:30.560 --> 00:41:33.020
But I thought you hated it

00:41:34.560 --> 00:41:38.230
If you compare when you returned from Danhyangok,

00:41:38.320 --> 00:41:41.530
looked much happier than when they just

00:41:42.530 --> 00:41:44.160
chilling at home

00:41:45.490 --> 00:41:48.410
That's why I couldn't stop you, despite all the danger

00:41:49.040 --> 00:41:50.080
I want

00:41:50.620 --> 00:41:55.420
so that you succeed in everything you choose for yourself

00:41:58.040 --> 00:41:59.170
Yes

00:42:03.170 --> 00:42:04.510
I have to go back

00:42:05.590 --> 00:42:07.260
Are you leaving?

00:42:07.350 --> 00:42:10.890
Yes. If you asked me to leave, I would do the opposite

00:42:10.970 --> 00:42:13.060
But after such a speech, we must return

00:42:13.140 --> 00:42:16.770
I have to do my best to make you proud

00:42:18.230 --> 00:42:20.530
And the head? Doesn't it hurt anymore?

00:42:21.230 --> 00:42:22.360
No

00:42:23.240 --> 00:42:25.240
Both people and horses

00:42:25.320 --> 00:42:27.570
teach with carrot and stick

00:42:28.780 --> 00:42:31.870
They just whipped me

00:42:32.450 --> 00:42:35.330
Who dared to hit you?

00:42:35.420 --> 00:42:37.880
Don't worry, I won't just stand there while they beat me.

00:42:39.840 --> 00:42:41.340
Wrap me some sweets

00:42:41.420 --> 00:42:42.840
A bunch of cookies

00:42:43.800 --> 00:42:46.510
- It will be fun
- Are you sure?

00:42:47.590 --> 00:42:48.680
Chan Wook

00:42:49.970 --> 00:42:51.100
You're finally here

00:42:51.810 --> 00:42:52.930
Yes

00:42:53.020 --> 00:42:55.810
It feels like you've all been waiting for me

00:42:56.440 --> 00:42:58.900
Does everyone want the cookies I brought?

00:42:58.980 --> 00:43:02.070
Go to the study hall. It will be fun

00:43:13.540 --> 00:43:15.620
- Were you waiting for me?
- Yes

00:43:15.710 --> 00:43:18.460
I'll be your first opponent

00:43:19.960 --> 00:43:20.790
What?

00:43:21.540 --> 00:43:23.340
Let's start the fight

00:43:24.090 --> 00:43:26.130
If you refuse, you lose.

00:43:27.010 --> 00:43:28.470
What are you talking about?

00:43:32.470 --> 00:43:34.100
Take

00:44:03.630 --> 00:44:04.710
Chan Wook lost

00:44:06.510 --> 00:44:09.430
Gyo Ho, the winner, can take back his golden toad

00:44:37.290 --> 00:44:38.660
What's going on?

00:44:38.750 --> 00:44:40.000
I bet

00:44:40.080 --> 00:44:42.380
I didn't argue with you about anything, Your Highness.

00:44:42.460 --> 00:44:45.210
Not with you, with your maid

00:44:49.300 --> 00:44:52.510
I told her that you can't defeat a single magician here.

00:44:52.590 --> 00:44:53.970
you can't

00:44:54.050 --> 00:44:57.060
And your maid said that you will win at least one

00:44:57.970 --> 00:44:59.810
Moo Deok said that?

00:45:01.770 --> 00:45:04.110
You will fight every day for ten days

00:45:04.190 --> 00:45:06.020
If you never win,

00:45:06.110 --> 00:45:08.570
she will give me the most precious thing she has

00:45:10.280 --> 00:45:11.360
Expensive?

00:45:12.530 --> 00:45:14.240
What's your favorite thing?

00:45:14.870 --> 00:45:16.620
What you gave me

00:45:18.700 --> 00:45:20.160
It's on the line

00:45:29.670 --> 00:45:32.300
This jade looks expensive, I want it for myself

00:45:34.510 --> 00:45:36.300
That's why I brought golden toads

00:45:36.390 --> 00:45:37.970
as a prize

00:45:44.650 --> 00:45:48.440
If you don't win before the toads are over,

00:45:48.520 --> 00:45:49.940
this will be mine

00:45:50.570 --> 00:45:52.820
I have little interest in such a debate

00:45:53.660 --> 00:45:56.410
I wasn't arguing with you, but with her

00:45:58.160 --> 00:45:59.490
If you give up

00:45:59.580 --> 00:46:02.080
that means she didn’t win a single fight, that means she lost

00:46:02.960 --> 00:46:04.080
And this will be mine

00:46:08.800 --> 00:46:09.920
Owner

00:46:11.170 --> 00:46:13.840
This is the most valuable thing I have ever received.

00:46:15.800 --> 00:46:19.310
Please take him back

00:46:30.440 --> 00:46:31.480
Look only

00:46:32.110 --> 00:46:33.740
You really got the golden toad

00:46:33.820 --> 00:46:37.370
Let Uk read "Words of the Heart"

00:46:37.450 --> 00:46:39.780
- but he doesn’t wield a sword well
- What's going on?

00:46:41.700 --> 00:46:44.540
The prince and Moo Deok had an argument

00:46:45.540 --> 00:46:48.840
The Crown Prince brought golden toads, so everyone wants to participate

00:46:50.250 --> 00:46:53.170
Strong magicians line up

00:46:55.170 --> 00:46:56.800
Put it down

00:47:04.230 --> 00:47:06.730
His Highness laughed at you

00:47:07.270 --> 00:47:09.270
As your teacher, I could not remain silent

00:47:09.360 --> 00:47:12.280
Don't lie. I know you

00:47:13.530 --> 00:47:15.240
I've been lazy these couple of days

00:47:15.320 --> 00:47:17.700
that's why you made a bet for me to train

00:47:20.200 --> 00:47:21.120
Yes

00:47:22.660 --> 00:47:26.960
You'll have to fight dozens of magicians whether you like it or not.

00:47:28.460 --> 00:47:31.630
The first fight was even more disappointing

00:47:32.250 --> 00:47:34.340
The step is heavy, you move the sword slowly

00:47:34.420 --> 00:47:37.680
- Tomorrow is a duel with...
- I refuse

00:47:40.970 --> 00:47:43.260
Even if you lose, you will remember what you saw,

00:47:43.350 --> 00:47:44.560
this will help you

00:47:44.640 --> 00:47:47.640
- I won't fight
- Ten fights -

00:47:47.730 --> 00:47:50.230
ten different styles

00:47:51.060 --> 00:47:52.570
- Moo Deok...
- Master,

00:47:52.650 --> 00:47:54.820
you can safely go home and soak

00:47:54.900 --> 00:47:57.200
Then you'll never get that jade back

00:47:58.780 --> 00:47:59.910
Okay, okay

00:48:00.950 --> 00:48:02.530
You argued

00:48:03.120 --> 00:48:04.120
But...

00:48:05.290 --> 00:48:07.000
Why did you put my gift?

00:48:07.710 --> 00:48:08.830
You know it yourself

00:48:09.330 --> 00:48:12.790
This was the only way to make you fight and win

00:48:15.550 --> 00:48:16.710
When I said I missed you

00:48:16.800 --> 00:48:19.340
Is this what you meant by my weakness?

00:48:22.180 --> 00:48:23.300
Yes

00:48:24.680 --> 00:48:26.470
You probably hate me now

00:48:27.680 --> 00:48:30.520
but you can't lose what belongs to us both

00:48:35.320 --> 00:48:37.610
Is that why you said I was poisoned?

00:48:37.690 --> 00:48:39.990
If you return it, I will smile wide at you

00:48:40.910 --> 00:48:42.280
Instead of an antidote

00:48:46.790 --> 00:48:47.910
Chan Wook

00:48:49.250 --> 00:48:50.750
Bring him back any way

00:48:51.830 --> 00:48:54.210
This is the most valuable thing I've ever had

00:48:55.670 --> 00:48:57.300
received in my entire life

00:49:00.010 --> 00:49:01.550
Is he really dear to you?

00:49:02.430 --> 00:49:03.680
Or...

00:49:05.140 --> 00:49:06.640
Is it just very expensive?

00:49:12.190 --> 00:49:14.230
I'll take it from the Crown Prince

00:49:15.150 --> 00:49:17.190
It's strange to have something paired with him

00:49:24.240 --> 00:49:26.490
But it wasn’t worth sharing with you either

00:49:48.350 --> 00:49:50.980
I heard you visit Saejukwon often

00:49:51.600 --> 00:49:54.810
Maybe you want to appoint Master Huo as your teacher

00:49:55.400 --> 00:49:57.650
and learn magic from him?

00:49:58.940 --> 00:50:00.150
What are you talking about?

00:50:00.900 --> 00:50:02.740
You are my teacher

00:50:03.820 --> 00:50:05.570
I only go there for treatment

00:50:05.660 --> 00:50:09.290
I breathe fresh air. Plus, funny things often happen there

00:50:09.370 --> 00:50:13.040
You must enjoy spending time with the magicians of Sosnovy Bor

00:50:13.120 --> 00:50:15.290
I communicate with Yul, my cousin

00:50:15.370 --> 00:50:17.540
Park Dan Gu is also fun

00:50:17.630 --> 00:50:20.880
Ah Chan Wook... I'd like to teach him a lesson, but it's not that easy

00:50:21.420 --> 00:50:23.970
He seems thrilled to have read Words of the Heart.

00:50:24.050 --> 00:50:26.010
so today I put it in its place

00:50:26.090 --> 00:50:28.600
He lost to a magician who had just mastered Ryusu

00:50:28.680 --> 00:50:30.810
Now people know its true power

00:50:30.890 --> 00:50:32.600
Nobody admires him anymore

00:50:39.610 --> 00:50:40.940
Beautiful jade

00:50:41.650 --> 00:50:43.820
I exchanged it for ten golden toads

00:50:44.820 --> 00:50:47.620
- Is he that valuable?
- It has Yin energy

00:50:48.320 --> 00:50:50.240
Where's the other half?

00:50:50.330 --> 00:50:51.370
Second half?

00:50:51.450 --> 00:50:53.870
Objects with opposite energy always have a pair

00:50:53.960 --> 00:50:56.210
There must also be red jade

00:50:56.960 --> 00:50:59.090
They only have value as a pair

00:51:03.840 --> 00:51:05.590
So he has a date?

00:51:06.090 --> 00:51:07.260
Eunuch O

00:51:08.050 --> 00:51:10.600
If people have twins, what could that mean?

00:51:10.680 --> 00:51:12.770
This means they are married or dating

00:51:15.230 --> 00:51:16.690
Damn it

00:51:17.310 --> 00:51:20.360
Don't you like this jade, Your Highness?

00:51:20.440 --> 00:51:23.860
Yes, he pisses me off. Gets on my nerves

00:51:24.360 --> 00:51:27.280
Take it and break it into little pieces

00:51:27.360 --> 00:51:29.990
You can't do this

00:51:30.070 --> 00:51:31.740
Chan Wook can win it back

00:51:34.200 --> 00:51:36.000
If he returns it,

00:51:36.870 --> 00:51:38.290
then they will become a couple again

00:51:39.710 --> 00:51:40.880
That's it

00:51:53.180 --> 00:51:54.350
- Master Li
- Yes...

00:51:57.480 --> 00:51:59.940
What brought you here?

00:52:02.270 --> 00:52:04.980
I've been wearing hemp clothes all year and never felt cold

00:52:05.820 --> 00:52:06.650
But

00:52:07.650 --> 00:52:09.360
I should have worn this scarf

00:52:10.240 --> 00:52:12.410
I realized how cold I was

00:52:14.910 --> 00:52:16.540
What's that there?

00:52:19.120 --> 00:52:20.120
What...

00:52:25.000 --> 00:52:28.670
Never in my life have flowers seemed beautiful to me,

00:52:30.090 --> 00:52:33.890
but once I saw these, I wanted to give them to you

00:52:41.150 --> 00:52:42.690
Beauty

00:52:43.690 --> 00:52:46.230
Is this for me?

00:52:53.660 --> 00:52:55.990
These books...

00:52:56.080 --> 00:52:57.450
You have good books here

00:52:58.620 --> 00:53:00.370
Great book

00:53:07.420 --> 00:53:08.920
Maid Kim...

00:53:10.010 --> 00:53:11.180
Are you sick?

00:53:11.260 --> 00:53:13.300
She hasn’t appeared in Sosnovy Bor for a long time

00:53:13.390 --> 00:53:14.930
She went there yesterday

00:53:15.550 --> 00:53:17.640
She often visits Mr. Chan

00:53:18.720 --> 00:53:19.890
Here's how

00:53:22.020 --> 00:53:24.480
She just didn't come see me

00:53:26.520 --> 00:53:28.780
She has a guest now

00:53:28.860 --> 00:53:30.650
Guest? Who?

00:53:30.740 --> 00:53:34.160
I don't know him, but he's a young man

00:53:34.950 --> 00:53:36.370
Young man?

00:53:37.370 --> 00:53:41.040
As far as I know, Maid Kim doesn't know any young men.

00:53:50.970 --> 00:53:52.590
Maid Kim

00:53:58.180 --> 00:53:59.520
Hello

00:54:01.350 --> 00:54:03.060
What kind of weeds are these?

00:54:03.140 --> 00:54:04.940
These are flowers

00:54:05.810 --> 00:54:08.020
- What other weeds?
- Maid Kim

00:54:08.520 --> 00:54:12.110
Were you offended because I was rude that day?

00:54:12.900 --> 00:54:14.410
Is that why they stopped coming?

00:54:15.450 --> 00:54:18.950
I really didn't know. Thought you were sick

00:54:19.030 --> 00:54:21.080
I was worried and came here

00:54:21.160 --> 00:54:22.870
You shouldn't have come

00:54:23.500 --> 00:54:25.580
You said you'd never come here

00:54:25.670 --> 00:54:27.670
When did I say that?

00:54:27.750 --> 00:54:29.170
You're wrong

00:54:30.590 --> 00:54:32.170
But still

00:54:32.260 --> 00:54:34.550
I'm glad you're healthy

00:54:40.430 --> 00:54:42.600
If they were so worried about my health,

00:54:43.770 --> 00:54:46.730
could at least bring weeds

00:54:46.810 --> 00:54:48.650
Do you need weeds?

00:54:49.230 --> 00:54:50.360
I'll bring them

00:54:52.110 --> 00:54:53.820
I don't need them

00:54:53.900 --> 00:54:57.910
I'm not asking you for weeds, but for flowers.

00:55:00.030 --> 00:55:01.620
I want you to show

00:55:01.700 --> 00:55:03.290
your concern,

00:55:04.370 --> 00:55:06.170
giving me something beautiful

00:55:12.960 --> 00:55:16.050
My guest is still here, you better leave

00:55:17.220 --> 00:55:18.470
Maid Kim

00:55:19.300 --> 00:55:20.510
Well...

00:55:21.810 --> 00:55:25.390
When you come to visit Uka,

00:55:27.190 --> 00:55:29.730
I hope you'll come see me

00:55:32.530 --> 00:55:34.490
Wait...

00:55:38.240 --> 00:55:39.990
Drives me because

00:55:41.160 --> 00:55:43.200
that I came empty-handed?

00:55:44.870 --> 00:55:46.080
Maid Kim

00:55:48.330 --> 00:55:49.750
How cold-blooded

00:56:14.610 --> 00:56:17.440
Since his shoes are smaller than mine,

00:56:18.900 --> 00:56:20.780
that means he's shorter

00:56:35.630 --> 00:56:37.920
Do you like sweets?

00:56:38.010 --> 00:56:38.880
Yes

00:56:45.220 --> 00:56:46.390
Delicious

00:56:47.640 --> 00:56:49.440
Then take some more

00:56:51.400 --> 00:56:52.520
This is for me

00:57:06.950 --> 00:57:09.000
- How do I look?
- Very beautiful

00:57:09.080 --> 00:57:10.750
- Try it on
- Me?

00:57:10.830 --> 00:57:11.750
So how?

00:57:11.830 --> 00:57:13.710
They hang him here

00:57:26.760 --> 00:57:30.560
Look, flowers

00:57:31.230 --> 00:57:33.270
You said that you should buy flowers

00:57:33.350 --> 00:57:36.570
I need them to decorate Boo Young unnie's room

00:57:38.070 --> 00:57:41.860
This time, apparently, they found her

00:57:49.200 --> 00:57:52.080
Really? Did Jin Mu find her?

00:57:53.540 --> 00:57:55.080
It's still a secret

00:57:56.250 --> 00:57:59.420
I hope unnie comes back

00:57:59.510 --> 00:58:03.260
Then you won't become Jinyaewon

00:58:03.340 --> 00:58:06.550
But I can marry whoever I want

00:58:07.680 --> 00:58:10.930
It will be possible to marry the one you love

00:58:13.440 --> 00:58:14.770
Glad to hear

00:58:16.730 --> 00:58:19.270
Then we need to break off our fake engagement

00:58:19.360 --> 00:58:22.740
Thanks for pretending to be my fiancé

00:58:25.410 --> 00:58:26.870
I didn't pretend

00:58:28.660 --> 00:58:29.790
My feelings

00:58:31.290 --> 00:58:32.750
sincere

00:58:36.420 --> 00:58:37.840
You will become the head soon

00:58:37.920 --> 00:58:41.710
Would you marry me? Would you join our family and leave everything?

00:58:43.010 --> 00:58:44.130
Yeah

00:58:44.970 --> 00:58:46.680
I guess I worried for nothing

00:58:46.760 --> 00:58:49.140
I was even preparing for

00:58:49.970 --> 00:58:51.430
that I will be kicked out of the family

00:58:53.140 --> 00:58:54.480
Are you serious?

00:58:55.310 --> 00:58:58.980
Did you want to give up your status as head of Sosnovy Bor for my sake?

00:58:59.060 --> 00:59:01.730
You said you don't want a loveless marriage

00:59:02.740 --> 00:59:04.610
Then I thought, if we get married,

00:59:04.700 --> 00:59:06.820
you will have a loving husband

00:59:09.370 --> 00:59:10.530
Therefore...

00:59:11.740 --> 00:59:15.410
Well, you have yet to meet the one you love

00:59:42.360 --> 00:59:44.230
It seems I'm already

00:59:45.940 --> 00:59:47.150
I met him

00:59:53.700 --> 00:59:55.950
If you hold on to me like this,

01:00:00.750 --> 01:00:02.590
I'll never let go

01:00:03.630 --> 01:00:05.420
My feelings are too strong

01:00:06.720 --> 01:00:08.630
There's no turning back

01:00:18.350 --> 01:00:21.610
You need to buy flowers to propose properly.

01:00:25.440 --> 01:00:26.650
Let's go

01:00:33.910 --> 01:00:37.580
Send these flowers to the Chan family

01:00:37.660 --> 01:00:40.750
Did someone die?

01:00:40.830 --> 01:00:42.880
Why are you sending them chrysanthemums?

01:00:46.590 --> 01:00:48.670
I almost made a big mistake

01:00:48.760 --> 01:00:49.800
Exactly

01:00:51.010 --> 01:00:52.260
From here

01:00:53.390 --> 01:00:54.890
all the way to here

01:00:54.970 --> 01:00:56.470
Send everything

01:00:56.560 --> 01:00:59.140
- All these flowers?
- Yes, that's it

01:00:59.230 --> 01:01:01.900
- I'm sure she'll like at least something.
- It can't be

01:01:01.980 --> 01:01:04.230
Thank you very much

01:01:06.900 --> 01:01:09.190
-Which ones do you like?
- These are these

01:01:09.900 --> 01:01:12.030
I can buy everything if you want

01:01:36.640 --> 01:01:38.680
You are the future head of Sosnovy Bor

01:01:39.850 --> 01:01:42.230
Why are you meeting with the future head of Jinyowon?

01:01:42.730 --> 01:01:43.810
Why?

01:01:44.480 --> 01:01:47.520
Do you want to give up your inheritance and join their family?

01:01:47.610 --> 01:01:51.200
Uncle, we love each other

01:01:51.860 --> 01:01:53.910
Not long ago Cho Young

01:01:54.820 --> 01:01:56.280
loved Uka

01:01:56.910 --> 01:01:58.950
No. Today she proved it to me

01:01:59.040 --> 01:02:03.000
Jo Young Says She Will Give Up Her Head Title For Love

01:02:03.080 --> 01:02:04.580
They only have one daughter

01:02:04.670 --> 01:02:06.210
Who will become the head of Jinyeowon then?

01:02:06.790 --> 01:02:09.250
She will be the eldest daughter

01:02:09.340 --> 01:02:12.800
Jeonbugwan's magicians help them find her missing sister

01:02:14.220 --> 01:02:15.140
What?

01:02:15.220 --> 01:02:17.930
Deputy Jin Mu comes to see them every day

01:02:19.640 --> 01:02:20.970
Jin Mu?

01:02:22.600 --> 01:02:24.560
If only I had a brother

01:02:24.650 --> 01:02:27.440
who will become the head instead of me

01:02:28.860 --> 01:02:31.320
I'm asking purely out of curiosity

01:02:32.110 --> 01:02:35.990
Uncle, are you sure you don’t have a child on your side?

01:02:39.910 --> 01:02:40.830
None?

01:02:42.450 --> 01:02:43.620
At all?

01:02:46.170 --> 01:02:47.000
Get out

01:02:48.750 --> 01:02:50.090
Get out

01:02:50.170 --> 01:02:51.300
What?

01:02:51.380 --> 01:02:52.460
Away!

01:02:54.630 --> 01:02:57.260
It's not too late, you can have a child now

01:02:57.340 --> 01:02:58.300
You...

01:02:58.390 --> 01:03:00.220
I mean, you're still full of strength

01:03:02.140 --> 01:03:04.230
Catch this scoundrel!

01:03:08.650 --> 01:03:09.900
Well, well

01:03:20.830 --> 01:03:23.160
Why are there so many flowers here?

01:03:23.830 --> 01:03:27.170
I had a fight with one person. So he's trying to make peace

01:03:28.710 --> 01:03:32.250
I hope you forgive him. These flowers are beautiful

01:03:34.670 --> 01:03:36.550
you are so kind

01:03:37.680 --> 01:03:39.720
Young Master Chan's mother...

01:03:40.300 --> 01:03:42.760
was as kind as you

01:03:43.770 --> 01:03:45.100
Apparently, Uk went into it

01:03:47.310 --> 01:03:48.310
Mister?

01:03:49.690 --> 01:03:53.070
What made you think that?

01:03:55.360 --> 01:03:57.360
When he talked about his mother,

01:03:57.450 --> 01:03:59.200
I felt warmth

01:04:00.240 --> 01:04:01.450
I saw it in his eyes

01:04:02.830 --> 01:04:03.660
Wait a minute...

01:04:04.410 --> 01:04:07.410
Did he talk to you about his mother?

01:04:08.710 --> 01:04:10.540
You must be very close to him

01:04:11.750 --> 01:04:13.630
Not at all

01:04:13.710 --> 01:04:15.710
Only Young Master Chan wants to get closer

01:04:15.800 --> 01:04:19.180
Last time he spent 4 hours with his mistress

01:04:20.300 --> 01:04:21.220
Is it true?

01:04:22.430 --> 01:04:24.220
We just talked for a bit

01:04:26.680 --> 01:04:29.440
It turns out it's you. Egret

01:04:30.690 --> 01:04:33.770
The gentleman may be cold, he has suffered in the past

01:04:33.860 --> 01:04:37.570
And how to open up to someone - kind and caring

01:04:39.530 --> 01:04:41.450
Come visit us more often

01:04:41.530 --> 01:04:43.780
Consider this place your nest

01:04:43.870 --> 01:04:46.290
and come here often

01:04:47.500 --> 01:04:48.660
Okay

01:04:55.380 --> 01:04:58.880
Jin Moo helps Jin Ho Kyung find his daughter?

01:04:58.970 --> 01:05:01.220
I think this is just an excuse

01:05:01.300 --> 01:05:03.140
visit Jinyeowon

01:05:03.930 --> 01:05:07.810
I think Jin Moo wants to get Jinyeowon's support

01:05:09.100 --> 01:05:11.650
If he succeeds,

01:05:12.440 --> 01:05:15.190
he will be able to resist Sosnovy Bor

01:05:15.270 --> 01:05:16.270
And then...

01:05:18.280 --> 01:05:20.650
he and his people without fear and regrets

01:05:22.660 --> 01:05:26.200
will reveal to the world the power of the ice stone

01:05:34.040 --> 01:05:38.260
One of Jin Mu's people has the stone

01:05:40.010 --> 01:05:43.220
Everyone thinks the stone is made of ice,

01:05:43.760 --> 01:05:48.390
but the forces of fire, water and wind are concentrated in it

01:05:49.310 --> 01:05:51.520
200 years ago, a magician from the Choi family created a reflector

01:05:52.230 --> 01:05:56.400
And now someone is using the power of the stone to do it again.

01:06:07.780 --> 01:06:11.500
New batch of reflectors made by the Queen

01:06:16.670 --> 01:06:19.420
Evil does not lie in the power of the ice stone.

01:06:19.500 --> 01:06:23.630
The reflector is what is used for evil purposes

01:06:26.930 --> 01:06:30.100
A power that is beyond the control of an ordinary person,

01:06:30.180 --> 01:06:32.430
will want to have everything if it becomes available

01:06:33.640 --> 01:06:36.190
The power to leave the old body

01:06:36.270 --> 01:06:38.020
and take a new one

01:06:39.770 --> 01:06:44.070
Old body in exchange for young, ugly for beautiful

01:06:45.360 --> 01:06:49.030
The power to stop death and make life eternal

01:07:04.720 --> 01:07:07.890
He is a young, healthy and wonderful young man

01:07:08.470 --> 01:07:09.470
He was chosen...

01:07:10.390 --> 01:07:13.640
my successor

01:07:14.430 --> 01:07:16.560
I want to migrate into his body

01:07:17.850 --> 01:07:19.270
Master

01:07:20.270 --> 01:07:22.650
What spell did you want to show me?

01:07:23.240 --> 01:07:24.570
Alchemy of souls

01:07:25.150 --> 01:07:26.400
Alchemy of souls?

01:07:28.070 --> 01:07:32.830
I still have so many things to do

01:07:33.450 --> 01:07:37.210
but this body is no good, the disease brings his imminent death closer

01:07:38.460 --> 01:07:39.540
Therefore...

01:07:40.960 --> 01:07:43.210
I need your body

01:07:47.550 --> 01:07:48.720
What?

01:08:05.990 --> 01:08:09.200
Let's start with the alchemy of souls

01:08:17.210 --> 01:08:19.250
Master, I don't want to switch bodies

01:08:19.830 --> 01:08:22.250
If I switch bodies with you, I will soon die

01:08:22.340 --> 01:08:24.300
But your body will live

01:08:35.390 --> 01:08:36.520
Help

01:08:37.140 --> 01:08:38.440
Save me

01:08:39.230 --> 01:08:42.150
Help me! Help!

01:08:44.610 --> 01:08:46.320
Master!

01:10:33.840 --> 01:10:35.010
Master

01:10:36.010 --> 01:10:37.010
My body...

01:10:37.100 --> 01:10:38.930
Take it all back

01:10:39.510 --> 01:10:41.730
Please. I don't want to die

01:10:41.810 --> 01:10:44.310
Master! Give me my body

01:10:44.390 --> 01:10:47.110
Master! I want to return to my body

01:10:47.190 --> 01:10:49.110
Master!

01:10:50.570 --> 01:10:54.860
Alchemy of souls helped save the life of another

01:10:55.700 --> 01:10:56.910
valuable magician

01:11:06.710 --> 01:11:07.920
While we

01:11:08.920 --> 01:11:10.670
we wield the power of stone,

01:11:10.750 --> 01:11:14.300
our souls will be able to live forever, and not rot in these bodies

01:11:15.340 --> 01:11:18.470
Now the power of the stone is prohibited,

01:11:18.550 --> 01:11:21.970
so you have to do alchemy secretly

01:11:22.060 --> 01:11:26.270
But sooner or later the day will come when our strength will grow stronger

01:11:26.350 --> 01:11:29.770
We will show everyone that we are right. Our hard work will pay off

01:11:31.150 --> 01:11:32.400
And on this day

01:11:33.530 --> 01:11:35.110
everyone here...

01:11:35.650 --> 01:11:39.030
will conquer death and gain eternal life

01:12:02.350 --> 01:12:03.930
Have you seen everything?

01:12:06.890 --> 01:12:07.980
Yes

01:12:08.060 --> 01:12:12.480
You must bring one person here

01:12:13.980 --> 01:12:17.820
Jin Ho Kyung will become your mother. Get closer to her

01:12:17.900 --> 01:12:20.740
And then bring her here

01:12:22.620 --> 01:12:24.040
Can you handle it?

01:12:27.790 --> 01:12:28.870
Yes

01:12:38.880 --> 01:12:40.300
She comes up

01:12:41.340 --> 01:12:43.720
If you can bring Jin Ho Kyung here,

01:12:45.010 --> 01:12:49.020
it will be easier to reveal the power of the stone to the whole world

01:13:40.650 --> 01:13:42.280
Why aren't you sleeping yet?

01:13:53.500 --> 01:13:55.460
Jin Mu can become

01:13:55.540 --> 01:13:59.710
stronger and more influential than we think

01:14:00.970 --> 01:14:05.010
Surely the King's star appeared to eliminate the chaos caused by the stone

01:14:07.470 --> 01:14:10.100
Are you talking about Uke?

01:14:10.180 --> 01:14:13.940
Master So Kyung, who prevented the horror of two hundred years ago,

01:14:14.020 --> 01:14:16.230
was also born under a similar star

01:14:16.310 --> 01:14:18.110
This star was created by magic

01:14:18.190 --> 01:14:20.070
She can't be compared to the star of Master Seo Kyung

01:14:21.360 --> 01:14:24.200
Did I mention that the star is the same?

01:14:26.030 --> 01:14:27.700
So I'm curious

01:14:30.790 --> 01:14:34.920
I wonder if this star will slowly go out

01:14:36.290 --> 01:14:37.880
or will it shine brightly?

01:15:16.080 --> 01:15:17.130
Victory!

01:15:17.210 --> 01:15:19.670
- Excellent
- Good job

01:15:19.750 --> 01:15:20.840
I knew it

01:16:03.760 --> 01:16:05.380
I knew about Tansa

01:16:06.130 --> 01:16:08.220
The prince didn't know, so you did it

01:16:08.300 --> 01:16:11.220
And even water from the puddle that everyone saw

01:16:11.300 --> 01:16:12.510
As easy as shelling pears

01:16:26.690 --> 01:16:27.950
Victory!

01:16:29.780 --> 01:16:32.620
- Great!
- Marvelous!

01:16:52.050 --> 01:16:54.260
Only three toads left?

01:16:54.350 --> 01:16:55.600
Yes

01:16:56.560 --> 01:16:59.690
So he's been fighting for the last seven days straight?

01:16:59.770 --> 01:17:01.850
And I kept losing

01:17:03.360 --> 01:17:06.190
I thought he would stop if he kept losing

01:17:09.070 --> 01:17:11.070
Apparently he's trying for this

01:17:11.160 --> 01:17:14.700
As you said, he doesn’t wield a sword well, his spells are weak

01:17:14.780 --> 01:17:16.200
But he continues to fight...

01:17:16.290 --> 01:17:18.830
just because he's annoying

01:17:19.330 --> 01:17:22.960
These are just fights, but he fights with other magicians every day

01:17:23.040 --> 01:17:24.590
He's definitely exhausted

01:17:24.670 --> 01:17:27.670
Your Highness, I believe in your victory

01:17:27.760 --> 01:17:30.720
Even I didn't have a chance to fight the magicians of Jeongjingak

01:17:30.800 --> 01:17:33.260
But I let Chan Wook do it...

01:17:33.340 --> 01:17:35.600
for your own golden frogs

01:17:35.680 --> 01:17:37.680
Has Won Moo Deok fooled me again?

01:17:57.870 --> 01:18:00.790
Fight and lose, Chan Wook

01:18:15.300 --> 01:18:18.220
Everything that doesn't kill you

01:18:23.190 --> 01:18:26.150
only makes you stronger

01:18:28.470 --> 01:18:48.560
Thanks for watching with us!
http://doramamania

01:18:56.560 --> 01:18:59.640
Alchemy

01:18:56.560 --> 01:18:59.640
Shower

01:18:59.560 --> 01:19:01.770
- Chan Wook!
-Have you come to the owner?

01:19:01.850 --> 01:19:04.100
Let him lose, he gets stronger

01:19:05.690 --> 01:19:06.520
Don't go

01:19:06.600 --> 01:19:08.400
Don't go to your room, stay here

01:19:08.480 --> 01:19:11.070
What a horror! Look at the shoes. All wet

01:19:11.150 --> 01:19:12.400
You're hurt

01:19:13.990 --> 01:19:17.490
There is commotion in the capital. Last night he was attacked by several assassins

01:19:18.570 --> 01:19:20.830
- Don't kill him!
- Kill him!

01:19:21.790 --> 01:19:23.870
- He's a nomad
- Come out!

01:19:23.960 --> 01:19:25.580
- I'm coming in
- Chan Wook

01:19:25.670 --> 01:19:29.960
I don't think it's right to let go of a magician who just got here so easily

01:19:30.040 --> 01:19:32.130
Once you go wild, you can't go back

01:19:32.210 --> 01:19:34.220
You can't become a man, only a monster

01:19:34.300 --> 01:19:36.880
We can protect the monsters of this world
